# char_update on its own: forty ticks of it, with area_update, at the entrance to Mud School (3700). Smokegod (60)
# hurts and afflicts the others, then they all stand idle; Pupil (10) casts on herself first.
# - hit points, mana and moves come back by position: Decimus sleeping, Purser resting, Pupil standing; Smokegod's
#   mana after his casts
# - Purser and Decimus poisoned shiver and suffer each tick; Pupil plagued writhes, and it may spread to the others
# - Pupil's detect invis (10 ticks) and armor (24) wear off, with their messages
# - Purser's torch, set to 3 hours, flickers and goes out
# - the banners the fixtures carry as lights burn down an hour a tick
# - hunger and thirst
# - after 12 idle ticks each mortal disappears into the void (Limbo) and is saved; after 30, they're quit
@updates area,char
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect pupil
Pupil
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer decimus 3700
transfer purser 3700
transfer pupil 3700
set skill pupil all 100
set char pupil mana 500
set char pupil hp 300
restore pupil
@as pupil
cast 'detect invis'
@pulse 24
cast armor
@pulse 24
@as god
cast 'cause light' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cause light' purser
@pulse 24
cast poison purser
@pulse 24
cast poison decimus
@pulse 24
cast poison decimus
@pulse 24
cast plague pupil
@pulse 24
peace
@obj 3030 3700 0 0 3 0 0
@as purse
get torch
remove banner
hold torch
rest
@as dec
sleep
@as god
@state
@pulse 240
@state
@pulse 720
@state
@pulse 1680
@state
@pulse 4800
@as god
look
@state
@pulse 2400
@state
